url: 'https://github.com/ftosoni/commons-uploader'
abstract: >-
  Commons Uploader is a Python script that uploads batches of photographs to Wikimedia Commons from a spreadsheet generated with Pattypan. It previews the file description pages, validates the spreadsheet, reads the camera model from EXIF data, supports the personality rights notice, and never stores passwords.
keywords:
  - Wikimedia Commons
  - batch upload
  - Pattypan
  - MediaWiki
  - mwclient
  - photography
  - Wikipedia
